description=RICOH GR, POP and Find X10 feature completion for PMA110 (Find X9 Ultra) and PKJ110 (Find X8 Ultra), both verified. Headless LSPosed companion. Device profile is detected at boot; see mount.log and bind.log. Requires a KernelSU metamodule (mountify tested).
